 "description": "Wang2007 - ATP induced intracellular Calcium Oscillation\nBioModels BIOMD0000000145 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000145_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 100 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000145_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: oscillating), sampling 0.1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 2.08e-06 of species peak (worst: Galpha_GTP)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] species 'PLC' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'DG' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] R9 term 1/2: non-integer reactant coefficient 0.01 on Ca_Cyt written as a Kintecus coefficient\n  [info] R9 term 1/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] R9 term 2/2: non-integer reactant coefficient 0.001 on Ca_ER written as a Kintecus coefficient\n  [info] R9 term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] R10: non-integer reactant coefficient 0.05 on Ca_Cyt written as a Kintecus coefficient\n  [info] R10: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed",
